:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Li'l Macho Legs Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Li'l Gross Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Lucky Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] grants improved health and attack power, a chance to knockback [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies and [[Barrier Breaker]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

