==Talents==
''Accessible at level '''30'''''

*'''[[Shield Piercing]]''': Adds a 3% chance to pierce shields, improves by 3% per level up to 30% (Total Cost: 165 NP)
*'''[[Knockback|Knockback]]''': Increases knockback chance by 1% per level up to 10% (Total Cost: 125 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Resist|Resist Curse]]''': Reduces curse duration by 16%, improves by 6% per level up to 70% (Total Cost: 125 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|HP Buff]]''': Upgrades health by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 125 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Attack Buff]]''': Upgrades attack power by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 125 NP)

